      "Contains erythritol, which some people find hard on the stomach"
    ],
    "bottomLine": "The Pro JYM to pick if you avoid artificial sweeteners and can live with 30 extra calories per scoop.",
    "specs": {
      "Protein / serving": "24 g in a 44 g scoop (label)",
      "Calories": "170",
